sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as E2E v0015 Client
    participant E as WSS /ws/v1/events :8443
    participant X as WSS /ws/v1/control :8443
    participant P as Proxy Core
    participant B as Mosquitto MQTTS
    participant M as Master
    participant W1 as Worker fn-01 + Cross Runtime
    participant S2 as fn-02 Protocol Simulator

    C->>E: connect + Bearer + subscribe(filters, replay cursor)
    E-->>C: subscription.accepted
    C->>X: connect + Bearer
    X-->>C: connection.ready
    C->>X: command.request(nodes.list / config.get)
    X->>P: shared dispatcher
    P->>B: fixed Master command
    B->>M: MQTTS command
    M-->>B: ACK / result
    B-->>P: validated result
    P-->>X: command.accepted + command.result
    X-->>C: correlated response

    C->>X: command.request(actuator.request fn-01)
    X->>P: validate + audit + idempotency
    P->>B: actuator.request
    B->>M: route to owner
    M->>B: distributed.actuator.execute
    B->>W1: execute
    W1-->>B: hardware readback
    B-->>M: operation result
    M-->>B: operation.result
    B-->>P: event
    P-->>E: filtered durable event
    E-->>C: CONFIRMED

    Note over W1,S2: Cross-Worker simulation, not Cross-Site
    Note over W1: external test launcher enabled Cross runtime; Worker package unchanged
    S2->>B: fn-02 registration + capabilities
    B->>M: validated registration
    M-->>B: admission decision APPROVED
    B-->>S2: admission state APPROVED
    M->>B: node:fn-02 Full rollout
    B->>S2: distributed.config.apply
    S2-->>B: exact fingerprint Apply-ACK
    B-->>M: rollout ACK
    S2->>B: heartbeat with replica revision/fingerprint
    B->>M: convergent fn-02 heartbeat
    M->>B: cross:fn-01.default rollout
    B->>W1: Cross shard
    W1-->>B: Cross convergence
    W1->>B: remote actuator intent for fn-02
    B->>M: fenced Cross intent
    M->>B: execute on owner fn-02
    B->>S2: simulated actuator.execute
    S2-->>B: simulation=true + deterministic readback
    B-->>M: result
    M-->>B: operation.result
    B-->>P: event
    P-->>E: Cross result
    E-->>C: CONFIRMED + simulation marker
